BT /F1 13 Tf 50 530 Td (1. Executive Summary & Problem Formulation) Tj ET
0.18 0.22 0.28 rg
BT /F2 9.5 Tf 50 506 Td (As Large Language Models transition into agentic assistants, connecting them to) Tj ET
BT /F2 9.5 Tf 50 493 Td (external enterprise resources, local filesystems, and databases has become paramount.) Tj ET
BT /F2 9.5 Tf 50 480 Td (Historically, every AI provider developed proprietary function calling schemas, custom) Tj ET
BT /F2 9.5 Tf 50 467 Td (webhook APIs, and ad-hoc plugin formats. This created severe ecosystem fragmentation and) Tj ET
BT /F2 9.5 Tf 50 454 Td (high integration friction.) Tj ET
0.18 0.22 0.28 rg
BT /F2 9.5 Tf 50 436 Td (The Model Context Protocol \(MCP\), open-sourced by Anthropic, addresses this challenge) Tj ET
BT /F2 9.5 Tf 50 423 Td (by establishing an open, universal, and bidirectional standard connecting AI models) Tj ET
BT /F2 9.5 Tf 50 410 Td (\(Clients\) with external execution environments and data repositories \(Servers\). This) Tj ET
BT /F2 9.5 Tf 50 397 Td (assignment designs, implements, and validates an enterprise MCP Server for AI assistants) Tj ET
BT /F2 9.5 Tf 50 384 Td (over standard I/O \(stdio\) using JSON-RPC 2.0 protocol specifications.) Tj ET
0.17 0.42 0.69 RG 1.5 w 50 362 m 562 362 l S
0.10 0.21 0.36 rg
BT /F1 13 Tf 50 366 Td (2. Model Context Protocol \(MCP\) Architectural Specification) Tj ET
0.17 0.42 0.69 rg
BT /F1 11 Tf 50 342 Td (2.1 Client-Server Topology & Transport Primitives) Tj ET
0.18 0.22 0.28 rg
BT /F2 9.5 Tf 50 324 Td (MCP utilizes a decoupled Client-Server architecture. The host application \(such as) Tj ET
BT /F2 9.5 Tf 50 311 Td (Claude Desktop, Antigravity, or an IDE\) operates as the MCP Client, while local or) Tj ET
BT /F2 9.5 Tf 50 298 Td (remote microservices act as MCP Servers. Communication occurs over standard streams) Tj ET
BT /F2 9.5 Tf 50 285 Td (\(stdio\) for local isolation or Server-Sent Events \(SSE\) for remote networks.) Tj ET
0.18 0.22 0.28 rg
BT /F2 9.5 Tf 50 267 Td (All message payloads adhere strictly to JSON-RPC 2.0 specifications:) Tj ET
