BT /F2 9 Tf 66 166 Td (structured content arrays.) Tj ET
0.17 0.42 0.69 rg
BT /F1 9.5 Tf 54 151 Td (- ) Tj ET
0.18 0.22 0.28 rg
BT /F2 9 Tf 66 151 Td (2. Resources \(Passive Context\): Passive, readable contextual endpoints addressed by) Tj ET
BT /F2 9 Tf 66 139 Td (custom URI schemes \(e.g. assistant://system_config\). Resources supply live data to) Tj ET
BT /F2 9 Tf 66 127 Td (models without executing code.) Tj ET
0.17 0.42 0.69 rg
BT /F1 9.5 Tf 54 112 Td (- ) Tj ET
0.18 0.22 0.28 rg
BT /F2 9 Tf 66 112 Td (3. Prompts \(Guided Interaction\): Pre-parameterized prompt templates provided by the) Tj ET
BT /F2 9 Tf 66 100 Td (server to guide user workflows and standardize assistant interactions.) Tj ET
